---
source: crates/cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: help
---
Local-first workbench for S3-compatible remote storage

Usage: rstore [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  connection  Manage storage connections
  bucket      Manage buckets
  workspace   Manage workspaces — named groups of buckets for listing and tagging
  remote      Live remote listing/stat
  index       Index & catalog control
  files       List and search files across workspace buckets
  tag         Workspace tags
  upload      Upload files to a remote bucket
  download    Download remote objects
  cp          Copy objects
  mv          Move/rename objects
  rm          Delete remote objects
  task        Inspect/control transfer jobs
  url         Generate object links
  catalog     Catalog maintenance
  config      Local configuration
  doctor      Environment & health diagnostics
  version     Print consolidated version information
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --config <PATH>      Override the data/config root directory
      --log-level <LEVEL>  Log level for stderr diagnostics [default: warn]
      --json               Emit machine-readable JSON with a stable envelope
  -q, --quiet              Suppress progress and successful human-readable output; errors remain on
                           stderr
  -h, --help               Print help (see more with '--help')
  -V, --version            Print version
